Here is a complete, executable single-file web application using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It uses the browser's native Web Audio API to generate the beat sounds, meaning you don't need to download any external audio files. 

You can save the code below as an `.html` file (for example, `rhythm_trainer.html`) and double-click it to open it in any modern web browser.

